Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "I'm concerned about our primary mission...
But first we have to rescue Princess Ruto.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "No one can pass through here!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "They don't look like they're willing to talk...
I guess we'll just have to force our way by.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "One more step, and we'll flatten you with
great, big boulders!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "We have to stop the falling rocks! Capture the
Boulder Keeps in the heart of the mountain!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "If we can capture the keeps in the heart of
the mountain, we might stop the rocks...",
  "1.0.6.0" => "All right! We'll climb the mountain and
capture the Boulder Keeps!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Yah! We can't advance with those rocks trying
to crush us!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "I always thought the Gorons were a gentle
people...",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Darunia, their chief... He was always so kind!
But ever since meeting Zelda...",
  "1.0.10.0" => "He's met with Princess Zelda?! But...even so...
Why would that force a negative change in him?",
  "1.0.11.0" => "We'll grab this keep!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Great! One more Boulder Keep remains!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Just one more Boulder Keep and we can
progress.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "If we don't capture the Boulder Keeps now,
the Allied Base will be smashed!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Capturing the Boulder Keeps is the only way
to save the Allied Base from crumbling...",
  "1.0.16.0" => "We captured it before our enemies had
the chance!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Great! We just have to capture the other
Boulder Keep too!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "One Boulder Keep left.",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Quickly, we must reclaim the Boulder Keeps!
Our base is in danger!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "If we don't retake the Boulder Keeps,
our base is in grave danger.",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Quickly, take over the Boulder Keeps! Our
base will crumble to pieces if we don't!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Our base is taking heavy damage! We must
capture the Boulder Keeps immediately!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Capture the Boulder Keeps immediately!
Our base won't last much longer!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Hurry! Capture the Boulder Keeps! Our base
can't take much more abuse!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Mmm... We might save time if we could just
cut through here...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "I see a shortcut up ahead. If only we could
get through...",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Wonderful! We've stopped the falling rocks!
Our base should be safe for now.",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Who dares attack the noble Gorons?! Whoever
you are, prepare to battle a Goron Chieftain!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Darunia has appeared! We have to knock some
sense into that thick head of his!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "So Darunia's decided to show his face. Very
well. We have no choice but to subdue him.",
  "1.0.31.0" => "We need him to calm down so we can get
some answers... We must knock him out!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Big brother Darunia! We're on it!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "S-such strength! If he carries on like this,
the keep will fall like a house of straw!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Darunia has infiltrated our base!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Darunia is attempting to destroy our
base. We can't let him!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Hurry! Darunia must be stopped! He's
smashing our base to pieces!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Stop Darunia! Our base is threatening
to crumble!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Not bad... I'll have to withdraw for now, but
only so I can strike back twice as hard!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Drat, he got away!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Snarf... Smack... GULP! Ahh, that's better.
I feel my strength returning...",
  "1.0.41.0" => "YEEEEEES! I'm back to fighting strength!
Brothers, we're marching out again!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "He's completely restored his strength! If this
carries on, we don't have a hope of winning!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "He's totally healed. Hmm. If we don't put an
end to this, this battle will just drag on.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "I wonder how he's replenishing his health...
Is his base hiding some secret?",
  "1.0.45.0" => "How is he restoring his health...? Will we find
some answers hidden in his base?",
  "1.0.46.0" => "I've got a plan! First, let's head for that keep.",
  "1.0.47.0" => "All right, I have an idea. First, we need
to go to that keep...",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Quick, capture that keep. We need it for my
plan to work properly!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "I need that keep for my plan. You have to
capture it, quickly!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Capture this keep immediately!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "You have to take this keep!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Get out of my way! I won't be slowed down!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Step aside. I won't be stopped.",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Brothers! Show them the strength of the
Goron tribe!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "We'll do you proud, Big Bro!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "If we leave Darunia to his own devices,
he's bound to cause us more trouble...",
  "1.0.57.0" => "I've got to fall back for a moment...",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Mmm, I'm all better! Good! Let's gooooo!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Brothers! Come! Let's give them a proper
Goron beatdown!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Everything's ready. Commence the plan!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "All ready. Let's get started.",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Hey! What's going on?!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Aaah! The premium rock sirloin I had hidden
in my chambers! It's ruined!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "GRAH! You! I won't forgive you!
Gorons! Move out!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "All right!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Darunia won't be able to regain stamina
anymore. It's time to take him down!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Let's blow up their base with a Bombchu!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "The famous Goron Bombchu... If we
don't stop them, our base is rubble!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "A Bombchu is approaching the base!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "We took a hit! Does the base still stand?",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Somebody must be controlling the Bombchu!
We have to find and defeat whoever it is!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "You, Bombchu! Head toward the Goron Keep!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Perfect. Just as we planned...",
  "1.0.74.0" => "I feel as if the sorceress is behind this...
Could her allies be controlling the Gorons?",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Whoa, I feel kinda strange...",
  "1.0.76.0" => "Huh? We surrender! We give up!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "I didn't realize what we were doing! Forgive
us! Someone was twisting our minds!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Would you mind kindly releasing Princess
Ruto?",
  "1.0.79.0" => "Oh! Yeah! Of course! Man, I feel terrible for
everything we've been doing...",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Well, that was a terrible experience...
I am Ruto, princess of the Zora!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "You want to know who caused this? I'll explain,
but not until we leave this filthy mountain...",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Our base has fallen!
That's it... It's all over...",
  "1.0.84.0" => "The base fell. We have no choice but
to surrender...",
  "1.0.85.0" => "We were so close to finding Princess Zelda...",
  "1.0.86.0" => "We were within reach of answers...
Forgive me...",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Guard that keep.
Our plan requires it.",
  "1.0.88.0" => "We've acquired the Bombchu. Now we can
take their keep in a single blow!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "If we use a Bombchu, taking the keep should
become vastly simpler.",
  "13.0.0.0" => "We have to stop the falling rocks. Perhaps
capturing the Boulder Keeps is a good start...",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Good. Now, let's capture the other Boulder
Keep.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "If we don't take the Boulder Keeps,
our base will be destroyed.",
  "13.0.3.0" => "We must capture the other Boulder Keep
as well.",
  "13.0.4.0" => "If we don't retake that Boulder Keep and
fast, the Allied Base is doomed.",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Hurry and take the Boulder Keeps. Our
base is taking severe damage!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Quickly, take the Boulder Keeps!
Our base is nearly destroyed!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "It may be quicker if we pass through here...",
  "13.0.8.0" => "So, Darunia has appeared...? Very well.
We must stop his rampage then.",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Darunia appears to be headed for our
base. We must do something...",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Hurry up and stop Darunia! He'll tear down
the Allied Base if left to his own devices!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "He looks like he hasn't a scratch on him...
Will there be no end to this battle?",
  "13.0.12.0" => "How in the world is he regaining health?
The secret must lie within the Goron base...",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Allow me to try something. First, I need to
get into that keep...",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Hurry and capture that keep. We need it to
put my plan into action.",
  "13.0.15.0" => "I'll capture this keep.",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Don't get in my way!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "We're ready. My plan begins...now.",
  "13.0.18.0" => "The Allied Base has fallen. We must
lay down our arms and surrender...",
  "13.0.19.0" => "I thought we stood a chance...
It seems I was very wrong...",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Could you guard that keep? We'll
need it intact for my plan to work.",
}